{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Myriath \u2014 a peaceful village, once cradled by ancient woods and protected by the sacred walls of our ancestors. Life flowed gently, guided by tradition and harmony. But something changed. Something monstrous. A force unlike anything we\u2019ve known tore through our sanctuary, ripping homes apart and crushing lives under its wrath. Now, our peace lies in ruins \u2014 and we must rise. Whatever it is, it must be stopped\u2026 at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Feature</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New match3 RPG system (runes can be swapped at any position)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Runes can be upgraded when requirements reached</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 bosses,\u00a0 each have their own unique skills</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667220?t=1744847802","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667220?t=1744847802","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667220/e25a683a7f0d16456fa178ce648a4ffb1c137c84/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744847802","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667220/e25a683a7f0d16456fa178ce648a4ffb1c137c84/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744847802","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work\r\n\r\n!!Warning!!\r\nThis game adult content including full nudity, sexual scenes. please make sure you are in the right place to avoid any unnecessary attention.\r\n\r\nAll characters involved in sexual content are over the age of 20."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=